; Synthetic golden-reconcile fixture — durability guardrail 1.
;
; Fictional institutions / products only (Northwind / Globepay / Summit /
; Meridian) — NEVER a real bank. Deliberately exercises the drift-prone grammar:
; an elided balancing posting, a multi-commodity FX conversion, @@ TOTAL-cost
; priced legs (a buy and a partial sell), posting-level institution/product tags,
; and an inline header tag. The golden_reconcile test parses this, rebuilds each
; transaction through the canonical event-builder, renders it, and reconciles the
; projected per-account/per-commodity balances against a frozen table — so any
; parser / renderer / balance-engine drift fails core's CI automatically.

2026-01-01 Opening Balance
    Assets:NonRegistered:CAD   1000.00 CAD
        ; institution: Globepay
        ; product: chequing
    Equity:OpeningBalance

2026-01-15 Salary  ; ref: PAY-0001
    Assets:NonRegistered:CAD   3000.00 CAD
        ; institution: Globepay
        ; product: chequing
    Income:Employment:Salary
        ; employer: northwind

2026-01-16 Groceries
    Expenses:Groceries   42.10 CAD
    Assets:NonRegistered:CAD
        ; institution: Globepay
        ; product: chequing

2026-01-17 Coffee
    Expenses:Coffee   5.25 CAD
        ; institution: Summit
    Liabilities:Credit Card:CAD
        ; institution: Globepay
        ; product: rewards-card

2026-01-20 FX conversion  ; ref: FX-0009
    Assets:NonRegistered:USD    100.00 USD
        ; institution: Meridian
    Assets:NonRegistered:CAD   -137.00 CAD
        ; institution: Meridian

